{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 10014, "name": "Alessio", "username": "alciregi", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/alciregi/{size}/5506_2.png", "created_at": "2019-09-05T07:58:21.158Z", "cooked": "<p>Hello.<br>\nI’m not saying that I will do it, but what is the process to become the new maintainer of an orphaned package?<br>\nHow to know why a package is now orphaned?</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 2, "updated_at": "2021-12-27T21:42:07.497Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 31, "reads": 21, "readers_count": 20, "score": 149.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 3706, "topic_slug": "orphaned-package-how-to-become-the-new-maintainer", "display_username": "Alessio", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 3, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Speak Up!", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 109, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/orphaned-package-how-to-become-the-new-maintainer/3706/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 10380, "name": "Fabio Valentini", "username": "decathorpe", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/decathorpe/{size}/29651_2.png", "created_at": "2019-09-06T08:57:11.434Z", "cooked": "<p>The procedure for orphaning, retiring, un-orphaning, and un-retiring packages is outlined on the fedora wiki:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Orphaned_package_that_need_new_maintainers\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Orphaned_package_that_need_new_maintainers</a></p>\n<p>As to why a packages was orphaned, this might not always be an easy question to answer. Sometimes packagers announce that they are orphaning packages on the “devel” mailing list, some don’t. So you might be lucky and find an explanation in the mailing list archives. Otherwise you can probably assume that the original maintainer just isn’t interested in the package anymore, or that they no longer have time to maintain it.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel@lists.fedoraproject.org/\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel@lists.fedoraproject.org/</a></p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 2, "updated_at": "2019-09-06T08:57:11.434Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 19, "readers_count": 18, "score": 18.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 3706, "topic_slug": "orphaned-package-how-to-become-the-new-maintainer", "display_username": "Fabio Valentini", "primary_group_name": "fesco", "flair_name": "fesco", "flair_url": "https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/a/f/af3a1ba1ca92e6d3195851ee9e6829a8a2e00586.png", "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 64, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Orphaned_package_that_need_new_maintainers", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Orphaned package that need new maintainers - Fedora Project Wiki", "clicks": 17}, {"url": "https://lists.fedoraproject